title: "CNRS Scientific Toolkit"
message: "CNRS means Complex Numeric Representation System. Version 0.18.0 provides exact finite CNRS-A addition, negation, and subtraction while preserving public APIs and the released addition relation. Python is independently implemented and theorem-aligned."
